Z||000000||FieroJoe||03-30-2001||11:29 AM||||Soon I will be on a plane on my spring break trip to montana.  Why montana, where it is cold and there is almost nothing to do for a spring break?  Because Im going snowboarding for the last time the season!  I can't wait.  I am going to Big Sky resort, a huge place with almost no lift lines (so I have heard).  I love the mountains so much, and I love the country out west.<P>This will be my second time in the rockies, I will take as many pics as I can!<P>maybe no body but me can understand it, but I am really excited about this trip!<P>------------------<BR>AIM: Snowboarder0311<BR>87 Coupe 5sp. - big resto in progress<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/profile_1.JPG"> ||||reg||14
